hash b582ddbe9140f272
note The handler: every act of the wizard, applied through App::wizard, which then rebuilds the wizard's Derived cache (refresh_wizard). Start opens it, FromHere opens it on the steps page for a symbol, Next and Back move between pages (Next only while building), Cancel drops it, Escape drops it only when nothing has been entered and otherwise keeps it and says cancel discards it (held), Return brings the Tour view forward from the strip in Source or Graph, Kind sets the tour's kind, Choose and UseFocus set the start symbol, Toggle ticks or unticks a row from its tick box, Expand opens a row's calls, More loads a row's calls not yet shown, Fold opens or closes a group of calls cut for the same reason. Edit and Apply are the edit page's (feature-edit-tour).

